title: Political Direction
subtitle: How PPS builds its influence.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_direction.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'direction') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.direction (catalogue 4.1; technical reference 10.5–10.6): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. Z — 0.51: the present line can be
// confirmed for 1 T and the usual wait; returning the card to the hand is free.
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'direction');
!}

= Political Direction

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @parliamentary_socialism
- @class_independence
- @workers_gains
- @democratic_movement
- @easy_discard

@parliamentary_socialism
title: Parliamentary socialism
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_direction +] ?][? if pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_present = 0 : Press campaigns on parliamentary socialism are stronger while a PPS bill is before the Sejm, and so are the campaigns “Land for the peasants” and “Work and benefits for the unemployed”. Grow every month: parliamentarism and reformism. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'parliamentary_socialism').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'parliamentary_socialism');
!}
go-to: result

@class_independence
title: Independent class politics
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_class_independence_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_direction +] ?][? if pl_stance_class_independence_present = 0 : Press campaigns on independent class politics are stronger, and so are the campaigns for the eight-hour day and against high prices. The Left backs a strike for the cabinet’s resignation but dislikes our entering a cabinet. Grow every month: radicalism and strike action. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'class_independence').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_class_independence_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'class_independence');
!}
go-to: result

@workers_gains
title: Defend the workers’ gains
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_workers_gains_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_direction +] ?][? if pl_stance_workers_gains_present = 0 : Campaigns in defence of the workers’ gains are stronger while the protection of the unemployed or the labour inspection works, and strongest when a cut threatens them; so are the campaigns for the eight-hour day and for work and benefits. Grow every month: unionism and strike action. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'workers_gains').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_gains_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'workers_gains');
!}
go-to: result

@democratic_movement
title: A broad democratic movement
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_democratic_movement_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_direction +] ?][? if pl_stance_democratic_movement_present = 0 : The campaign “In defence of the Republic” is stronger, and press campaigns in defence of democracy are stronger whenever democracy is threatened. Grow every month: federalism and the worker-peasant alliance. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'democratic_movement').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_democratic_movement_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'democratic_movement');
!}
go-to: result

